{
  "title": "Dynamo vLLM",
  "uid": "dynamo-vllm-template",
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "schemaVersion": 38,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 100,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Deployment Config",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 200,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Static deployment metadata\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| **Run** | `nemotron-nano-v3-clean` |\n| **Model** | `nvidia/NVIDIA-Nemotron-3-Nano-30B-A3B-BF16` |\n| **Image** | `nvcr.io/nvidia/ai-dynamo/vllm-runtime:1.1.0` (vLLM 0.19.0) |\n| **Router mode** | `round-robin` (KV mode incompat. w/ NemotronH hybrid cache) |\n| **Worker count** | 4 \u00d7 2 GPU on NVIDIA-GB300 |\n| **TP size** | 2 |\n| **GPU memory util** | 0.85 |\n| **Client concurrency** | `num_samples_in_parallel=8` |\n| **Agent** | `mini_swe_agent` (`concurrency=16`) |\n| **Sandbox** | apptainer + jothomson arm64 SIFs |\n\n\u26a0\ufe0f NemotronH hybrid (Mamba + Attention) \u2192 `vllm:kv_cache_usage_perc` not emitted, KV cache % panels show N/A.\n"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 201,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "vllm:cache_config_info (live)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "vllm:cache_config_info{pod=~\"$pod_regex\"}",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "Value": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "container": true,
              "endpoint": true,
              "instance": true,
              "job": true,
              "namespace": true,
              "engine": true,
              "dynamo_component": true,
              "dynamo_endpoint": true,
              "dynamo_namespace": true,
              "worker_id": true
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 202,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Max Context Length",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        }
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max(dynamo_frontend_model_context_length{pod=~\"$pod_regex\"})",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 203,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Max Batched Tokens",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        }
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max(dynamo_frontend_model_max_num_batched_tokens{pod=~\"$pod_regex\"})",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      }
    },
